{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2021-11-16 01:48:00', 'title': 'AIR TANZANIA ANNOUNCES ORDER FOR BOEING FREIGHTER AND PASSENGER JETS', 'text': 'DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE: BA] AND THE UNITED REPUBLIC OF TANZANIA TODAY ANNOUNCED AN ORDER FOR A 787-8 DREAMLINER, A 767-300 FREIGHTER AND TWO 737 MAX JETS AT THE 2021 DUBAI AIRSHOW. THE AIRPLANES WILL BE OPERATED BY AIR TANZANIA, THE NATIONAL FLAG-CARRIER OF TANZANIA, TO EXPAND SERVICE FROM THE COUNTRY TO NEW MARKETS ACROSS AFRICA, ASIA AND EUROPE.'}